 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Come on, there's no need to hate them. Just avoid using bright colors and keep food in tight lids. Then use a mesh bag instead of a box, or spread the sandwiches in single layers. Wasps are attracted to sweetness. It gives you peace of mind, but it' the door you open that counts. Wasps are very territorial, so one already living near you. They'll usually leave you alone if you leave them alone first. Just keep your food covered and wash up after yourself.",
